---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Website Privacy | 5VA Appliance Repair"
  description="How 5VA handles calls, texts, optional Google Analytics and ad-call measurement, privacy choices, Google Maps and customer review information."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Privacy</span>
      </div>
      <h1>
        Your details
        <br />
        Handled with care
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">Privacy information for this website. Last updated October 26, 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose" style="max-width:800px">
      <h2>Information you choose to share</h2>
      <p>
        Contact 5VA directly by calling or texting +1 (267) 704-8588. This website has no inquiry
        form and does not collect your name, ZIP code or appliance description through website
        fields. Calls and messages use your own telephone or messaging provider.
      </p>
      <h2>How service information is used</h2>
      <p>
        Information you send to the business is used to respond to your inquiry, clarify the job,
        and arrange requested services. Send only details relevant to the repair. Please keep
        payment information, access codes, and sensitive documents out of an initial inquiry.
      </p>
      <h2>Website storage and measurement</h2>
      <p>
        The website has no customer accounts or inquiry forms and does not store appliance details
        in your browser. Optional Google Analytics and ad-call measurement do not load until you
        choose “Allow measurement”. The website remembers your choice, the permission version and
        its date in local browser storage for up to 180 days. A previous call-only permission does
        not enable this expanded measurement. The hosting provider may process ordinary technical
        access logs, such as IP addresses and request times.
      </p>
      <h2>Optional website analytics</h2>
      <p>
        With your permission, Google Analytics measures page visits and clicks on call and SMS
        links. The click events include the page and a general button location, such as the header
        or footer. This helps us understand which pages help visitors contact 5VA. We send page
        addresses without query strings or fragments, and only the referring website’s origin. We do
        not send your message, name, appliance details or ZIP code in these click events.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google may use analytics cookies and process technical information about your browser and
        device. Google Signals and personalized advertising are disabled in this website’s setup. A
        call-button click does not establish that a call connected, and an SMS-button click does not
        establish that a message was sent or received. These events do not confirm a lead,
        appointment or completed repair.
      </p>
      <h2>Optional Google ad-call measurement</h2>
      <p>
        If you choose “Allow measurement”, Google’s ad-call tag may receive your IP address, device
        information and page URL, including advertising click information, and use advertising
        cookies or browser storage. For eligible visits from Google ads, Google may show a
        forwarding phone number that connects to 5VA. This helps measure calls and their duration; a
        call must last at least 60 seconds to count as this website’s Google Ads call conversion. A
        phone-button click alone does not confirm a connected call or an appointment.
      </p>
      <p>
        This optional setup is not used for personalized advertising or enhanced conversions. Text
        messages always go directly to +1 (267) 704-8588; message contents and delivery are not
        measured by the Google call tag. Calls and texts remain available if you decline, if a
        forwarding number is unavailable, or if the tag is blocked. This does not measure every
        visit or every call to the business.
      </p>
      <p>
        Open “Privacy choices” in the footer to change your decision. Turning measurement off stops
        website click measurement, restores the business number, clears known first-party analytics
        and advertising measurement cookies where your browser allows, and reloads the page without
        the Google tag. This cannot erase information already sent to Google or remove cookies held
        on Google’s own domains. Google’s privacy practices apply to its services. Your choice is
        optional and does not affect access to repair services.
      </p>
      <h2>Google Maps and reviews</h2>
      <p>
        Selected short review excerpts are displayed with their authors and a link to the original
        Google listing. The displayed rating and count include a check date. Google Maps is
        available through external links; this website does not embed or load a Google map. Opening
        a Google link takes you to its service, where Google’s own privacy practices apply.
      </p>
      <h2>Images and fonts</h2>
      <p>
        Website images and fonts are served with the site. Photos in the home page work gallery come
        from the business’s Google profile. Blog covers are illustrative design imagery and are not
        presented as photographs of completed customer jobs or company staff.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions and requests</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about information you have shared with 5VA, call{' '}
        <a href="tel:+12677048588">+1 (267) 704-8588</a>. Please describe your inquiry so the
        business can identify the relevant conversation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
